  "questions": [
    {
      "math_academy_id": "q-42377",
      "knowledge_point_id": "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140",
      "knowledge_point": "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication",
      "problem": "$$\nL=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0\\end{aligned}],\\,M=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 5 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,N=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 5 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $L,M,$ and $N?$\n\n- The product $ML$ is well defined\n- The product $MN$ is well defined\n- The product $LN$ is well defined",
      "worked_solution": "Notice that $L$ is a $2\\times 3$ matrix, $M$ is a $2\\times 3$ matrix, and $N$ is a $3\\times 2$ matrix.\n\nThere are $3$ columns in $M$ and $2$ rows in $L.$ Since the number of columns in $M$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $L,$ the matrices $M$ and $L$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{M}_{2\\times 3}{\\times }_{\\ne }{L}_{2\\times 3}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $3$ columns in $M$ and $3$ rows in $N.$ Since the number of columns in $M$ equals the number of rows in $N,$ the matrices $M$ and $N$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{M}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{3}}}{\\times }_{✓}{N}_{\\boxed{\\text{3}}\\times 2}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $3$ columns in $L$ and $3$ rows in $N.$ Since the number of columns in $L$ equals the number of rows in $N,$ the matrices $L$ and $N$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{L}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{3}}}{\\times }_{✓}{N}_{\\boxed{\\text{3}}\\times 2}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nTherefore, statements II and III are true, while statement I is false.",
      "answer_fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "II and III only"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "III only"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "II only"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I and II only"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I and III only"
            }
          ],
          "correct_value": "II and III only",
          "choices_complete": true,
          "correct_origin": "ma_successful_grade"
